* SPICE Netlist for the Circuit

* Voltage Source
V1 0 2 DC V_S

* Capacitors
C1 0 1 C_in
C2 2 3 C_H
C3 3 4 C_L

* Current Source
G1 0 3 0 1 G_m

* Resistor
R1 3 4 R_0

* Node Definitions
* 0 -> Ground
* 1 -> VX (Cin connection)
* 2 -> Voltage Source Positive Terminal
* 3 -> Junction between CH and GM
* 4 -> Junction at Vout

.end